{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slide, shoot, bounce, &amp; whip your way through colorful worlds and dangerous obstacles!!!\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/bang.png?t=1744351567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of D-MAN, an undead acrobat, as he aids Death herself in collecting souls. This is all in an effort to help is new friend Sprite, a small alien butterfly, collect the Trinity Heart shards to save her home planets from an oncoming war!!!! It won't be easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/bandicam_2025-01-16_08-39-10-208.png?t=1744351567\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/bandicam_2024-10-01_14-25-23-029.png?t=1744351567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse strange, mysterious, and COLORFUL worlds full of challenging platforming goodness! D-MAN is quick on his feet, but also easy to stumble! Keep up the pace in each stage to form a rhythm to get you through safe and sound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/bandicam_2024-08-12_22-11-45-512.png?t=1744351567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thankfully, D-MAN won't be alone in his endeavors! Encounter weird and quirky characters to help piece together this mess!!!!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/bandicam_2024-08-11_16-19-07-573.png?t=1744351567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">D-MAN is versatile!!! Keep exploring to unlock new abilities!!!! There's more than one way to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/grab.png?t=1744351567\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/grab2.png?t=1744351567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll be doing a lot of tricky maneuvers to get through each stage!!! Although D-MAN is more than equipped... will he be enough???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591250?t=1744351567","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/db36bfd695fc64a5718b88237be37b6cdf945cce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744351567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/5b2c03ffe0990be7598cd41748afbe4144b278d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744351567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/5b2c03ffe0990be7598cd41748afbe4144b278d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744351567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slide, shoot, bounce, &amp; whip your way through colorful worlds and dangerous obstacles!!!\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/bang.png?t=1744351567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of D-MAN, an undead acrobat, as he aids Death herself in collecting souls. This is all in an effort to help is new friend Sprite, a small alien butterfly, collect the Trinity Heart shards to save her home planets from an oncoming war!!!! It won't be easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/bandicam_2025-01-16_08-39-10-208.png?t=1744351567\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/bandicam_2024-10-01_14-25-23-029.png?t=1744351567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse strange, mysterious, and COLORFUL worlds full of challenging platforming goodness! D-MAN is quick on his feet, but also easy to stumble! Keep up the pace in each stage to form a rhythm to get you through safe and sound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/bandicam_2024-08-12_22-11-45-512.png?t=1744351567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thankfully, D-MAN won't be alone in his endeavors! Encounter weird and quirky characters to help piece together this mess!!!!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/bandicam_2024-08-11_16-19-07-573.png?t=1744351567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">D-MAN is versatile!!! Keep exploring to unlock new abilities!!!! There's more than one way to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/grab.png?t=1744351567\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/extras/grab2.png?t=1744351567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll be doing a lot of tricky maneuvers to get through each stage!!! Although D-MAN is more than equipped... will he be enough???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Hushed Dreamware"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591250/8f06ab658d6ab4787c063ca8e6951d4d714b42f0/header.jpg?t=1744351567","is_